      "example_num": 3,
      "example_text": "Input: grid = [\"/\\\\\",\"\\\\/\"]\nOutput: 5\nExplanation: Recall that because \\ characters are escaped, \"\\\\/\" refers to \\/, and \"/\\\\\" refers to /\\.",
